From 85aa1938c258ce91268f63361659179c3f191141 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.local>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 03:52:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add TypeSafe System One (Jev) integration: chat intent
 routing + farm advisory composite scoring

services/typesafe.py: thin httpx System One client (zero new dependencies).
Best-effort by design: every failure returns None and callers fall back to the
existing deterministic keyword/threshold logic. Retries 429/5xx/network with
backoff; confidence gates every decision.

services/chat.py: keyword-only intent classification upgraded to TypeSafe-first
routing (one batched Choice + 2 Noul per turn). Same intent labels, so downstream
behavior is unchanged; meta now carries intent_engine/intent_confidence.

services/advisory.py + routers/mobile.py: /advisory now also emits per-hour
activity bands (irrigation/spraying/field_work) for the app's action-window bars,
plus one fan-out System One call scoring each day per activity. Code owns the
merge: high-confidence verdicts can only make days MORE conservative, an
'Unsafe' activity score floors that day's hourly cells, low-confidence answers
are recorded but change nothing. All new response fields are additive.

routers/dev.py: ai_decisions diagnostics block. .env.example: TYPESAFE_* keys.

74 tests pass (offline via httpx.MockTransport); existing tests unchanged.
